{"text": "Suddenly a soft voice called, Nibble, nibble, gnaw, who is nibbling at my little house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children answered, It is only the wind, and kept eating. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the door opened, and a very old woman came out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She gave them milk and pancakes and two soft white beds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the old woman was really a wicked witch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had red eyes and could not see very far. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had built the sweet house to catch children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the morning she locked Hansel in a small cage. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel is too thin, I want to make him fatter, she told Gretel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every day the witch said, Hansel, hold out your finger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Hansel held out a little bone instead.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", " ", "v", "o", "i", "c", "e", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", ",", " ", "N", "i", "b", "b", "l", "e", ",", " ", "n", "i", "b", "b", "l", "e", ",", " ", "g", "n", "a", "w", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "i", "b", "b", "l", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "t", " ", "m", "y", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", "e", "d", ",", " ", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "k", "e", "p", "t", " ", "e", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ",